<title>UK: LIFFE coffee moves higher, cocoa down AM.</title>
<headline>LIFFE coffee moves higher, cocoa down AM.</headline>
<text>
<p>COFFEE - Bucks opening call to move higher. Sept up $10 at $1,630.</p>
<p>COCOA - Down, but off lows. Volume thin. Sept down six stg at 1,041, after low of 1,030.</p>
<p>SUGAR - Firmer in AM with October dominating volume. October up $1.50 at $320.00 at 0940 GMT</p>
</text>
